        <body>
            <div xml:id="toc">

                <pb facs="0003" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Contents</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">(<hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>: For previously
                    published correspondence on relations between the United States and Japan in
                    1938, see <ref target="frus:frus1931-41v01"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Volumes I</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus:frus1931-41v02">II</ref>. Documents printed in those volumes
                    have not been reprinted in the 1938 annual volumes.)</p>
                <list type="toc">
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Undeclared War Between Japan and China</hi>: <list>
                            <item>Political and military developments: <list>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg1">Chapter I: January 1–31,
                                        1938</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg62">Chapter II: February 1–March 14,
                                            1938</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg123">Chapter III: March 15–May 31,
                                            1938</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg191">Chapter IV: June 1–August 31,
                                            1938</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg273">Chapter V: September 1–October 31,
                                            1938</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg354">Chapter VI: November 1–December 31,
                                            1938</ref></item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg441">Developments with respect to “Manchoukuo”;
                                    border hostilities between Japanese and Soviet
                                troops</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg488">China’s appeal for sanctions against Japan
                                    under the Covenant of the League of Nations</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg519">Consideration of possibilities of financial
                                    aid to China; extension of credit by Export-Import
                                Bank</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg591">Efforts of China to secure war material from
                                    other countries</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg613">Bombing by the Japanese of civilian
                                    population in China; appeal by the Department of State to
                                    American firms not to export aviation material to
                                Japan</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg626">Representations to the Japanese Government
                                    with respect to the integrity of the Chinese Maritime Customs
                                    and Salt Revenue Administrations</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><ref target="#pg755"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Index</hi></ref></item>
                </list>
